    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Dexterity and Wisdom 13+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Dexterity or Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Enveloping Mist.</strong> When you cast a spell or use a feature that restores Hit Points to a creature, a healing mist wraps around it. Roll one of the dice of the feature that healed it and note the number: it is the creature's Life Cocoon value.</p><p>If the creature is hit by an attack roll before the start of its next turn, you can take a Reaction to reduce the damage it takes from that attack by its Life Cocoon value; the mist then disappears. If the mist is still there at the start of the creature's next turn, the creature gains Temporary Hit Points equal to its Life Cocoon value.</p>",
